{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/b759bbd1f0f047caf1507e20100460fd.avif?t=1759217937\" width=780 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/f5df7be517c571abd354055598db2f68.poster.avif?t=1759217937\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/f5df7be517c571abd354055598db2f68.webm?t=1759217937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/f5df7be517c571abd354055598db2f68.mp4?t=1759217937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the shadows with Bullet Noir, an ambient twin-stick shooter where every move counts and every bullet could be your last. In this gritty, brutal world, you\u2019ll follow the intertwining stories of four relentless characters, each driven by a burning desire to avenge the murder of their mentor.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/d5a667cca94ba524f568cf876820fd75.avif?t=1759217937\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Twin-Stick Shooting Action: Choose your approach\u2014go in guns blazing or stealth your way through. The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Gameplay: Uncover the motivations and backstories of four distinct characters as you weave through a compelling narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Skills: Master each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome challenges and outsmart enemies in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter-Based Structure: Experience the story from multiple perspectives, with each chapter focusing on a different character\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir Art Style: Immerse yourself in a captivating art style that brings a dark and gritty atmosphere to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Way Down: Navigate the gloomy city from a distinctive top-down perspective, offering relentless and challenging gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/567afcc41a42ba51aec0692b0db4ee55.poster.avif?t=1759217937\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/567afcc41a42ba51aec0692b0db4ee55.webm?t=1759217937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/567afcc41a42ba51aec0692b0db4ee55.mp4?t=1759217937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a city that bleeds noir from every alleyway, Bullet Noir offers a visually striking experience with its stark, high-contrast art style. The game\u2019s narrative is rich and layered, revealing the dark secrets and personal vendettas that bind these characters together. Revenge is your only path to redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/extras/ada03ad2acd4e50d0d5885cbc4df2f24.avif?t=1759217937\" width=780 height=120 /></span> In <strong>Bullet Noir</strong>, vengeance isn\u2019t just a mission, it\u2019s a way of life. Are you ready to dive into the shadows and uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/24af92ff07b744e5c60ac0fab04d351e7061d27a.jpg"},{"name":"50 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/1bb37dd10722e2667fe024634d55ed5a71723351.jpg"},{"name":"500 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/0eb751e7b80b1e8a680d8b372e2c9869769e8d4b.jpg"},{"name":"1500 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/59a854a6dbfe51e6d056470900c39a11a4129d7a.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/1d12970c361050c5f3e12ce1f2fedbe63f98f2c6.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/04e753bfa29cf28e852523d0f9f1658e81a60e2c.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/62dd42fa2646765746ec3cbe37af00b366beef3d.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/8614c4d2ab045dde74875c4402e0f00282e1e321.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/0404d878ad11f6781da89fdfa80b0a589b6c138f.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Bronze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3204960/acb611bbb82b161c70b565b7e00f4319c4a1b813.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204960?t=1759217937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/0d2dab24ebf41919d20420fbfb61035e4b6aa42e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759217937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204960/1dc974d5537cc4b5cceeb60c960d85df433d0506/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759217937","capsule_image